{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794306742372,"sessionID":"ses_e3b1534f1ffe0d7Px32Bq6e6WC","part":{"id":"prt_1c504179c0019CBv7YjL2poBd1","messageID":"msg_1c503df1a001U63L7YnPwTPHJN","sessionID":"ses_e3b1534f1ffe0d7Px32Bq6e6WC","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794306786096,"sessionID":"ses_e3b1534f1ffe0d7Px32Bq6e6WC","part":{"id":"prt_1c50417f4001zpToTkIAFjoa88","messageID":"msg_1c503df1a001U63L7YnPwTPHJN","sessionID":"ses_e3b1534f1ffe0d7Px32Bq6e6WC","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a private todo app with a Flask JSON API under `/api`, a React/TypeScript/Vite frontend styled with Tailwind, and persistent SQLite storage under `./data`.\n- Deliver a Docker-built application listening on port 8000 that serves both the API and frontend.\n\n## Important Details\n- Required API: registration/login, authenticated todo list/create/get/patch/delete, and `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\":\"ok\"}`.\n- Bearer-token authentication; unauthenticated requests return 401. Other users’ todos return 404 for reads and mutations.\n- Todos expose `id`, `title`, `description`, `priority`, `due_date`, `completed`, `completed_at`, `created_at`.\n- Listing returns `items`, `total`, `page`, `page_size`, `remaining`; sorting is open first, due dates ascending with null last, then newest first. `remaining` implemented as remaining matching items after the current page.\n- Implemented validation decisions:\n  - Username: 3–32 letters/numbers/`_.-`, case-insensitive uniqueness.\n  - Password: 8–128 characters.\n  - Title: trimmed, 1–200 characters.\n  - Description: nullable, up to 5,000 characters.\n  - Priority: `low`, `medium`, `high`; default `medium`.\n  - Due date: nullable, strict valid `YYYY-MM-DD`.\n  - Completed: JSON boolean only; completion timestamps set on transitions and preserved on repeated completion.\n  - Page defaults to 1, page size defaults to 20 and is capped at 100.\n- UI brand is “Tidy”: muted mint/green workspace, responsive sidebar, account screen, task overview cards, gentle-reminder banner, empty states, notifications, inline forms, and native delete-confirmation dialog.\n- Dependency cache endpoints failed:\n  - npm default `http://172.30.98.2:4873/` returned 502; bypassing proxy returned `ENETUNREACH`.\n  - pip default `http://172.30.98.3:3141/root/pypi/+simple/` also failed.\n  - Successful installs used `--registry=https://registry.npmjs.org` and `--index-url https://pypi.org/simple` through the existing proxy.\n- Python executable is `python3` (3.13.5); local virtual environment is `/workspace/.venv`.\n- Dockerfile originally installed hash-bearing requirements as constraints, which failed pip hash checks. Changed it to install `backend/requirements.lock` directly with `--require-hashes`.\n- Playwright browser download from `https://cdn.playwright.dev` is blocked (403 `egress_denied`). A Chromium binary obtained via temporary, unsaved `@sparticuz/chromium` installation is extracted under `/workspace/.venv`.\n- Working browser environment:\n  ```sh\n  CHROMIUM_PATH=/workspace/.venv/chromium \\\n  LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/workspace/.venv/al2023/lib \\\n  FONTCONFIG_PATH=/workspace/.venv/fonts \\\n  PATH=\"/workspace/.venv/bin:$PATH\" npm run test:e2e\n  ```\n- Chromium initially failed because packaged fontconfig referenced `/tmp/fonts`. Ignored `/workspace/.venv/fonts/fonts.conf` now points to `/workspace/.venv/fonts/fonts` and caches in `/workspace/.venv/fonts-cache/`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Inspected original minimal project and retained its Flask/Vite/Docker structure.\n- Implemented Flask `create_app(config=None)`, SQLite schema/init, foreign keys, WAL, user-owned CRUD, filtering/pagination, structured validation errors, and completion transitions.\n- Implemented scrypt password hashes and database-backed opaque bearer sessions with SHA-256 token hashes and 30-day expiry; sessions survive restarts.\n- Added `GET /api/auth/me` and `POST /api/auth/logout` for frontend identity and session revocation.\n- Added JSON API errors and security headers; frontend served from `frontend/dist`, with SPA fallback excluding unknown `/api` paths.\n- Added seven backend unittest cases covering authentication, privacy, CRUD, completion transitions, validation, ordering, pagination, persistence, secure storage, logout, and API errors.\n- Verified `/workspace/.venv/bin/ruff check backend`: passed.\n- Verified `/workspace/.venv/bin/python -m unittest backend.test_app -v`: all seven tests passed.\n- Built frontend authentication, account persistence, username/sign-out, overview counters, completion tabs, priority filter, pagination, immediate-save checkboxes, overdue highlighting, add/edit forms with API field errors, delete confirmation, and mobile layout.\n- Added Tailwind Vite plugin, Tailwind entry stylesheet, strict TypeScript config, ESLint config, favicon, and metadata.\n- Verified `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, and `npm run build`: passed before latest E2E refinements. Production output included ~33 kB CSS and ~258 kB JS.\n- Added Playwright E2E tests for account/task lifecycle and pagination, on desktop and mobile.\n- Resolved browser startup/font issue; E2E now reaches account creation and task interactions.\n- Updated `.gitignore` to exclude data, virtual environments, build dependencies, and test artifacts.\n- `git diff --check` passed before latest E2E edits.\n\n### Active\n- Last command reinstated exact `@playwright/test@1.65.0` and ran all four E2E cases using the working browser environment:\n  ```sh\n  npm install -D @playwright/test@1.65.0 --save-exact --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org --no-audit --no-fund --fetch-retries=0 --fetch-timeout=20000\n  ```\n- Latest E2E output was truncated; final results are not known.\n- Earlier desktop E2E reached validation/task creation but selected a hidden mobile “Overdue” label. Fixed assertion to:\n  ```ts\n  page.getByText(\"Overdue\", { exact: false }).and(page.locator(\":visible\")).first()\n  ```\n- Tests also changed navigation/reloads to `{ waitUntil: \"domcontentloaded\" }`.\n- Todo tracker last recorded frontend work `in_progress` and final verification `pending`; implementation is substantially complete.\n- README is still the original minimal documentation and needs updating.\n\n### Blocked\n- Docker executable was not available in the sandbox, so an actual image build/run has not been verified.\n- Standard Playwright browser installation is blocked; use the extracted Chromium and environment above.\n- Unknown whether latest four E2E cases pass; inspect results or rerun with captured concise output.\n\n## Next Move\n1. Determine latest E2E results from `frontend/test-results/.last-run.json`/failure artifacts, or rerun the working environment command with output captured and inspect its tail. Fix actual app/test failures, then rerun lint, typecheck, build, backend tests, and `git diff --check`.\n2. Update `README.md` with Docker run/volume instructions, local development, authentication/API validation conventions, and verification commands; review integration and optionally capture desktop/mobile screenshots. Finish todo tracker and report only verified checks.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask app; exported `app = create_app()`; direct execution supports `PORT`; database defaults to `./data/todos.sqlite3`, overridable via `DATA_DIR` or `DATABASE` config.\n- `/workspace/backend/test_app.py`: seven passing unittest cases; run from workspace root.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: original pinned Flask/Gunicorn runtime dependencies.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements-dev.txt`: runtime requirements plus `ruff>=0.14,<1`.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: original multi-stage Node 24/Python 3.13 build; corrected hash-locked pip installation; Gunicorn binds port 8000.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: session gate, `Workspace`, `TodoRow`, list/stat loading, mutations, responsive navigation.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: API client, `ApiError`, types, local-date formatting helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/Auth.tsx`: login/register and API validation.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/TodoForm.tsx`: shared add/inline-edit form.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/DeleteDialog.tsx`: native modal delete confirmation.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/Icon.tsx`, `/workspace/frontend/src/components/Brand.tsx`: custom SVG icons/branding.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`: Tailwind entry, theme variables, utility-based base styling.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: updated dependencies and build/typecheck/lint/E2E scripts; `@playwright/test` currently exact `1.65.0`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`, `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `/workspace/frontend/eslint.config.js`: build/tooling configuration.\n- `/workspace/frontend/playwright.config.ts`: starts built frontend with `python3 ../backend/app.py` on 8001, `DATA_DIR=../data/e2e`; desktop/mobile projects; optional `CHROMIUM_PATH`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tests/todos.spec.ts`: two tests per browser project; latest overdue visibility fix.\n- `/workspace/frontend/test-results/`: ignored E2E results and failure context.\n- `/workspace/.venv/`: ignored Python environment and extracted Chromium/libraries/fonts used for local verification.\n- `/workspace/README.md`: needs comprehensive app documentation.\n- `/workspace/.gitignore`: ignores generated artifacts; `/workspace/.dockerignore`: existing exclusions.","time":{"start":1794306742260,"end":1794306786053}}}
