{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794306794192,"sessionID":"ses_e3b1534f1ffe0d7Px32Bq6e6WC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_0Qdp7ilyP9KnVkLKqlM1GE79","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/frontend/package.json"},"output":"<path>/workspace/frontend/package.json</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: {\n2:   \"name\": \"app-frontend\",\n3:   \"private\": true,\n4:   \"type\": \"module\",\n5:   \"scripts\": {\n6:     \"dev\": \"vite\",\n7:     \"build\": \"tsc --noEmit && vite build\",\n8:     \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n9:     \"lint\": \"eslint .\",\n10:     \"test:e2e\": \"playwright test\"\n11:   },\n12:   \"dependencies\": {\n13:     \"react\": \"19.3.1\",\n14:     \"react-dom\": \"19.3.1\"\n15:   },\n16:   \"devDependencies\": {\n17:     \"@eslint/js\": \"^10.0.1\",\n18:     \"@playwright/test\": \"1.65.0\",\n19:     \"@tailwindcss/vite\": \"^4.3.5\",\n20:     \"@types/node\": \"^26.6.6\",\n21:     \"@types/react\": \"^19.3.0\",\n22:     \"@types/react-dom\": \"^19.3.0\",\n23:     \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"6.2.1\",\n24:     \"eslint\": \"^10.14.0\",\n25:     \"eslint-plugin-react-hooks\": \"^7.1.1\",\n26:     \"eslint-plugin-react-refresh\": \"^0.5.7\",\n27:     \"globals\": \"^17.14.0\",\n28:     \"tailwindcss\": \"^4.3.5\",\n29:     \"typescript\": \"^6.0.3\",\n30:     \"typescript-eslint\": \"^8.72.2\",\n31:     \"vite\": \"8.3.5\"\n32:   }\n33: }\n\n(End of file - total 33 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"name\": \"app-frontend\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"tsc --noEmit && vite build\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\",\n    \"test:e2e\": \"playwright test\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"19.3.1\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"19.3.1\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@eslint/js\": \"^10.0.1\",\n    \"@playwright/test\": \"1.65.0\",\n    \"@tailwindcss/vite\": \"^4.3.5\",\n    \"@types/node\": \"^26.6.6\",","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/frontend/package.json","text":"{\n  \"name\": \"app-frontend\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"tsc --noEmit && vite build\",\n    \"typecheck\": \"tsc --noEmit\",\n    \"lint\": \"eslint .\",\n    \"test:e2e\": \"playwright test\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \"19.3.1\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"19.3.1\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@eslint/js\": \"^10.0.1\",\n    \"@playwright/test\": \"1.65.0\",\n    \"@tailwindcss/vite\": \"^4.3.5\",\n    \"@types/node\": \"^26.6.6\",\n    \"@types/react\": \"^19.3.0\",\n    \"@types/react-dom\": \"^19.3.0\",\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"6.2.1\",\n    \"eslint\": \"^10.14.0\",\n    \"eslint-plugin-react-hooks\": \"^7.1.1\",\n    \"eslint-plugin-react-refresh\": \"^0.5.7\",\n    \"globals\": \"^17.14.0\",\n    \"tailwindcss\": \"^4.3.5\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^6.0.3\",\n    \"typescript-eslint\": \"^8.72.2\",\n    \"vite\": \"8.3.5\"\n  }\n}","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":33,"totalLines":33,"truncated":false}},"title":"frontend/package.json","time":{"start":1794306793984,"end":1794306794120}},"id":"prt_1c504e1f20016JonXkBN7csx3p","sessionID":"ses_e3b1534f1ffe0d7Px32Bq6e6WC","messageID":"msg_1c504d0090010ef2LSqFYJVHCX"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794306794192,"sessionID":"ses_e3b1534f1ffe0d7Px32Bq6e6WC","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_HjlzOae4rFXi7kwRAnvVGopm","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/README.md"},"output":"<path>/workspace/README.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # App\n2: \n3: ## Run contract\n4: \n5: - The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n6: - The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n7: - The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n8: - Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n9: \n10: ## Layout\n11: \n12: - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n13: - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n14: \n15: Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n\n(End of file - total 15 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/README.md","text":"# App\n\n## Run contract\n\n- The app is built from `Dockerfile` in this directory and the container listens on port 8000.\n- The API is served under `/api`. `GET /api/health` answers `{\"status\": \"ok\"}` once the app is ready.\n- The backend also serves the frontend build at `/`.\n- Persistent data lives in `./data` (relative to the working directory `/app`).\n\n## Layout\n\n- `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n- `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n\nDependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":15,"totalLines":15,"truncated":false}},"title":"README.md","time":{"start":1794306794011,"end":1794306794130}},"id":"prt_1c504e20c001yKJYTBSmLrPe7w","sessionID":"ses_e3b1534f1ffe0d7Px32Bq6e6WC","messageID":"msg_1c504d0090010ef2LSqFYJVHCX"}}
