n+- `backend/app.py`: Flask application, authentication, SQLite initialization, and todo API.\n+- `backend/test_app.py`: API unit tests using temporary databases.\n+- `frontend/src/`: React workspace, shared forms, API client, and Tailwind styling.\n+- `frontend/tests/`: Playwright browser tests.\n+- `frontend/dist/`: generated production frontend, served by Flask.\n+- `data/`: generated persistent SQLite data; never included in the image.\n \n-Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n+Runtime Python dependencies are hash-locked in `backend/requirements.lock` and installed directly with `--require-hashes`. Frontend dependencies are locked in `frontend/package-lock.json` and installed with `npm ci`. Update the corresponding lock file when changing dependencies.\n","additions":104,"deletions":9}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM README.md","time":{"start":1794307046804,"end":1794307046834}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq8vO_j8B2ZYsRA0IgA7nQDuf1GvEqfUgQVDTpwRJCPapBKTf7N_T8dLhO--2emNBvxzm1eKUgagE_ib5_WQM-L8vtWqcuuEyeoMbZotnQi_NiKzi098nyfhf7YKX7iDhdTkBKY1Ez17IAQVc5F9Rvv0Xn_qEGjW4fxnENzbzAqx4TW9MBovu1WF4Mdc9WCJafnwGSpOduMW5IaqT1lilYqiZn1Uzx5vrbyfvcvSmVzn44nFlwxIu4sLZIFmhCmIAZlgxc_r8Tlq4eBHjCBtzbSVX1kf8wKuQm7v8dld_paRsFmN4EhrFzNutzi1KbURGDoh8FYvDWrfsS2oAf8obfEvsPq2ZMqkg-8fZxkHYZ311rkzC3xd15KHMa--IiX-WSLFm5wGg_YwpivRULvCarpNmZcpRgs05GdOEy6KrvfRFols0pW7JILLSau1rXUjl1rayxGgWpQ2n5zhz4pS9TQh_dDG-7DHYugdv4Wg4OKczdGGHeM4SIkuEaPjIyu-Sr4vhMV5lEGp7Xbya8vlxSi5U9M4Okd49PIWIXOxZ0Z_qaip7P1bRECpAmdL0QSGr1krv_JiW84_o6ezepcbN2RGZ-gVo5J5WeK8P6fjkXlC9Cy_ndzOWwnxSIiQ4H_72HsLAgCYmiXNEU7GOqLfUz1XmKWNuuPuFJOpNZ6I4tKSLKKk8Ih715ltBZKSV8SNL1VHZ31hz3KJZuwOtGihAgPSuZM4Mto